entals, warehouse management, procurement, inventory control, logistics operations, ERP/SCM software, global trade compliance, marine logistics, and AI-driven supply chain analytics.</p> </div> </div><div class="faq__item" role="listitem" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2" id="faq-btn-2" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <span class="faq__q-text" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3>What is Marine Logistics?</span> <span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3></polyline> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-2" hidden data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <p class="faq__answer-text" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3>Marine Logistics covers port operations, shipping management, cargo handling, freight forwarding, customs clearance, and maritime trade documentation — essential skills for careers in shipping, ports, and offshore logistics.</p> </div> </div><div class="faq__item" role="listitem" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3" id="faq-btn-3" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <span class="faq__q-text" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3>Who can join these courses?</span> <span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3></polyline> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-3" hidden data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <p class="faq__answer-text" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3>Plus Two and above students, graduates, and working professionals looking to enter or advance in supply chain, logistics, warehousing, procurement, or marine operations.</p> </div> </div><div class="faq__item" role="listitem" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <button class="faq__question" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4" id="faq-btn-4" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <span class="faq__q-text" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3>Does SMECLabs provide placements?</span> <span class="faq__icon" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3></polyline> </svg> </span> </button> <div class="faq__answer" id="faq-answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="faq-btn-4" hidden data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3> <p class="faq__answer-text" data-astro-cid-h4zmggu3>Yes. We provide dedicated placement assistance, resume building, mock interviews, and direct connections to 200+ hiring companies in logistics, shipping, supply chain, and port operations across India and the GCC.</p> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>  <script type="module">document.querySelectorAll(".faq__question").forEach(e=>{e.addEventListener("click",()=>{const n=e.getAttribute("aria-expanded")==="true",r=e.getAttribute("aria-controls"),a=r?document.getElementById(r):null;document.querySelectorAll(".faq__question").forEach(t=>{if(t!==e){t.setAttribute("aria-expanded","false");const d=t.getAttribute("aria-controls"),i=d?document.getElementById(d):null;i&&(i.hidden=!0)}}),e.setAttribute("aria-expanded",String(!n)),a&&(a.hidden=n)})});</script> <section id="cta" class="cta" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii> <!-- Background layers --> <div class="cta__bg" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii></div> <div class="cta__blob cta__blob--tl" aria-hidden="true" data-astro-cid-coyjnsii></div> <div class="cta__blob cta__blob--br" ari